<title>USA: Ultramar to announce purchase of Total U.S. assets.</title>
<headline>Ultramar to announce purchase of Total U.S. assets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ultramar Diamond Shamrock said Tuesday that it will shortly hold a telephone conference to announce details of its purchase of French oil major Total SA's North American assets.</p>
<p>A spokesperson declined to give any further details.</p>
<p>In February, Total executives said in response to a Wall Street Journal story that Ultramar would pay $830 million for Total Petroleum (North America) Ltd, that the company was keeping its options open.</p>
</text>
